uction and buy a portrait of  Trump to go up in one of trumps golf  clubs as we've previously reported which  Donald Trump later reimbursed with  donated funds meant to be charitable  contributions and then Cohen also gets  into what we now know is the truth  Trump Tower Moscow which is that  negotiations were taking place about  Trump Tower Moscow during the campaign  and what this means is that you  simultaneously had Russia trying to help  Donald Trump defeat Hillary Clinton and  at that same time you had Donald Trump  negotiating to build from tower Moscow  there were plans a builder had been  lined up there was the idea of giving  Vladimir Putin a 50 million dollar  penthouse as a sort of sweetener to make  the building more appealing to other  oligarchs and Cohen interestingly in the  midst of all this explained how Trump  tells him to lie he says Trump doesn't  show up and say go and lie Trump shows  up and looks at him and says there's no  business in Russia Michael there's no  business in Russia and it's a sort of  wink wink for Michael Cohen to go out  there and to say what Trump knows is a  lie and what Cohen knows is a lie and  what everybody knows is a lie which is  that there actually is business in  Russia this is how a mob boss operates  meanwhile according to Michael Cohen  Trump would ask him regularly how's it  going in Russia how's it going in Russia  because everybody knew that there was  business going on in Russia that's not a  question especially when you ask it six  times  that suggests Trump is unconcerned with  what's going on in Russia or the Trump  isn't aware or involved in any of it  racism Cohen says Trump told him black  people would never vote for him because  they were too stupid Cohen says Trump  regularly inflated his assets to be  listed as wealthier on the Forbes list  exactly as we suspect it and might  explain why Trump is desperate for his  tax returns not to become public Cohen  explained that Trump directed him to  threaten lawsuits against Trump schools  if they ever disclosed his grades or SAT  scores because they're terrible and when  it comes to Russia Cohen says he doesn't  have proof but he has suspicions and he  actually tells the story of a time  shortly before the Trump Tower meeting  took place when he was in Trump's office  and in comes Donald Trump jr. and walks  right behind Trump's desk something that  people would rarely  do and leans in close and says quietly  but loud enough for Michael Cohen to  hear that the meeting is all set and  Trump says okay good let me know Michael  Cohen now believes that that was indeed  when Donald Trump was being told that a  meeting with Russian actors meant to  provide dirt on Hillary Clinton had been  arranged had been confirmed and would be  taking place again direct contradiction  of what Donald Trump previously said we  were told by Trump and attorneys and all  sorts of people that hot Trump had no  idea whatsoever about it of course the  more we learn the more we realize that  nothing goes on nothing goes on around  Trump without Donald Trump's specific  involvement and Michael Cohen testified  to that as well today okay so what are  going to be the reactions to this  Republicans as I mentioned went in ready  with attack questions and just trying to  attack Michael Cohen's credibility as  someone who can't be believed Michael  Cohen is simply saying yes I I did lie  before and I'm going to prison for it  and I take responsibility he's there  voluntarily it would be extraordinarily  boneheaded I mean Paul Manafort did it  but it would be extraordinarily  boneheaded at this point to voluntarily  put yourself under oath and tell lies  that you know are going to be  scrutinized and could lead to even more  significant jail time prison time etc so  on the one hand playing it  conservatively  if only 5% of what Michael Cohen says  and has said today is true it is a  blockbuster of absolutely historic  proportions that being said I don't