uth  whether consequences will come out of it  whether there will be any willingness by  the Republicans to say you know what  we've got to put party aside and we have  to take this seriously because it is  serious this is the crisis not what's  going on at the us-mexico border then  maybe we will actually see consequences  or the potential of consequences  otherwise I would not be holding my  breath let me know on Twitter what you  make of the testimony whether you think  it will have any actual material impact  on the future of Donald Trump's  presidency I'm skeptical but I'm willing  to have my mind changed  on Twitter at D Pakman the show is on  Twitter at David Pakman show

